%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d6e68035b0b6c8a418e4ba69a861bf1d, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueDatabase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueDatabase
  entries:
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Evening. Got a room for one night?
      textKo: "\uC548\uB155\uD558\uC138\uC694. \uD558\uB8FB\uBC24 \uBB35\uC744 \uBC29
        \uD558\uB098 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uAE4C?"
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Just the one night. I'm back on the road at first light.
      textKo: "\uB531 \uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uC774\uBA74 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB0A0 \uBC1D\uC73C\uBA74
        \uBC14\uB85C \uB5A0\uB0A0 \uAC70\uB77C\uC11C\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Been walking since dawn. I'm done in.
      textKo: "\uC0C8\uBCBD\uBD80\uD130 \uACC4\uC18D \uAC78\uC5C8\uB354\uB2C8 \uC644\uC804\uD788
        \uB179\uCD08\uAC00 \uB410\uB124\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: name
    labelEn: Ask their name
    labelKo: "\uC774\uB984\uC744 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Just call me a traveler. Names don't buy much out here.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uB098\uADF8\uB124\uB77C\uACE0 \uD558\uC8E0. \uC774\uB7F0
        \uB370\uC11C \uC774\uB984\uC774 \uBB34\uC2A8 \uC18C\uC6A9\uC774\uACA0\uC5B4\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: where
    labelEn: Ask where they're headed
    labelKo: "\uC5B4\uB514\uB85C \uAC00\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Somewhere the road stops. You know any place like that?
      textKo: "\uAE38\uC774 \uB05D\uB098\uB294 \uACF3 \uC5B4\uB514\uCBE4\uC774\uC694.
        \uADF8\uB7F0 \uB370\uB97C \uC544\uC2ED\uB2C8\uAE4C?"
    choices:
    - labelEn: I wish I did
      labelKo: "\uC800\uB3C4 \uC54C\uBA74 \uC88B\uACA0\uB124\uC694"
      goToNode: where_a
    - labelEn: Just take the room
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uBC29 \uC4F0\uC138\uC694"
      goToNode: where_b
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: where_a
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Yeah. Figured as much.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uB807\uACA0\uC8E0. \uADF8\uB7F4 \uC904 \uC54C\uC558\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: where_b
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Fair enough. Lead the way.
      textKo: "\uC54C\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC548\uB0B4\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Confirm how long they're staying
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60 \uBB35\uC744\uC9C0 \uD655\uC778\uD55C\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: One night. Same as I said. I won't be a bother past dawn.
      textKo: "\uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uC774\uC694. \uC544\uAE4C \uB9D0\uC500\uB4DC\uB9B0
        \uADF8\uB300\uB85C\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB0A0 \uBC1D\uAE30 \uC804\uC5D0 \uC870\uC6A9\uD788
        \uB098\uAC08 \uAC70\uC608\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Take one night up front
      labelKo: "\uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uCE58\uB97C \uC120\uBD88\uB85C \uBC1B\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_pay
    - labelEn: Settle up when they leave
      labelKo: "\uB098\uAC08 \uB54C \uC815\uC0B0\uD558\uAE30\uB85C \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_trust
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_pay
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Up front. Alright. I'll have it ready for you.
      textKo: "\uC120\uBD88\uB85C\uC694. \uC54C\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC900\uBE44\uD574
        \uB450\uC8E0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_trust
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Appreciated. You'll get it at the door.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB098\uAC08 \uB54C \uB4DC\uB9AC\uC8E0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Housekeeping? Whatever's easiest for you.
      textKo: "\uCCAD\uC18C\uC694? \uD3B8\uD558\uC2E4 \uB300\uB85C \uD558\uC138\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Tidy the room each morning
      labelKo: "\uB9E4\uC77C \uC544\uCE68 \uBC29\uC744 \uC815\uB9AC\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_yes
    - labelEn: Only go in when he asks
      labelKo: "\uBD80\uB97C \uB54C\uB9CC \uB4E4\uC5B4\uAC04\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_no
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_yes
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Suits me. One less thing to think about.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uAC8C \uC88B\uC8E0. \uC2E0\uACBD \uC4F8 \uC77C \uD558\uB098
        \uC904\uACE0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_no
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Fine. I'll knock if I need anything.
      textKo: "\uC54C\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uD544\uC694\uD558\uBA74 \uBD80\uB974\uC8E0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn them away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: No room? After all that walking?
      textKo: "\uBC29\uC774 \uC5C6\uB2E4\uACE0\uC694? \uC774\uB807\uAC8C \uAC78\uC5B4\uC654\uB294\uB370\uC694?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: reject_insist
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_insist
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I won't be trouble. Gone by first light.
      textKo: "\uD3D0 \uB07C\uCE58\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC744\uAC8C\uC694. \uB0A0 \uBC1D\uC73C\uBA74
        \uBC14\uB85C \uB5A0\uB098\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Hold firm
      labelKo: "\uB2E8\uD638\uD558\uAC8C \uAC70\uC808\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_final
    - labelEn: Reconsider
      labelKo: "\uB2E4\uC2DC \uC0DD\uAC01\uD574 \uBCF8\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...Fine. I've slept in worse than a ditch.
      textKo: "...\uC54C\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB3C4\uB791\uC5D0\uC11C\uB3C4
        \uC790\uBD24\uB294\uAC78\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. You won't hear a sound from me.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC18C\uB9AC \uD558\uB098 \uC548 \uB0B4\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin_paid
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Here - the night, paid in full.
      textKo: "\uC5EC\uAE30 - \uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uCE58, \uC120\uBD88\uAE08\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC804\uC561\uC774\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. You won't hear a sound from me.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC18C\uB9AC \uD558\uB098 \uC548 \uB0B4\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: What do you want at this hour?
      textKo: "\uC774 \uC2DC\uAC04\uC5D0 \uBB34\uC2A8 \uC77C\uC774\uC2ED\uB2C8\uAE4C?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: noise
    labelEn: Ask about the noise last night
    labelKo: "\uAC04\uBC24\uC758 \uC18C\uC74C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Noise? I was asleep the whole time.
      textKo: "\uC18C\uC74C\uC774\uC694? \uC800\uB294 \uBC24\uC0C8 \uC790\uACE0 \uC788\uC5C8\uB294\uB370\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: heard
    labelEn: Ask if he heard anything
    labelKo: "\uBB54\uAC00 \uB4E4\uC740 \uAC8C \uC5C6\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Wind on the window. A door down the hall, once. Then nothing.
      textKo: "\uCC3D\uBB38\uC5D0 \uBC14\uB78C \uC18C\uB9AC. \uBCF5\uB3C4 \uC800\uCABD\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uBB38\uC18C\uB9AC \uD55C \uBC88. \uADF8\uB7EC\uACE4 \uC870\uC6A9\uD588\uC5B4\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 1
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: leaving
    labelEn: Ask when he's leaving
    labelKo: "\uC5B8\uC81C \uB5A0\uB0A0 \uAC74\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: The moment you let me. I've a long way to go.
      textKo: "\uBCF4\uB0B4\uC8FC\uC2DC\uB294 \uB300\uB85C \uBC14\uB85C\uC694. \uAC08
        \uAE38\uC774 \uBA38\uB2C8\uAE4C\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Ah - yes. Hello. A room. Please. Just the one.
      textKo: "\uC544, \uB124. \uC548\uB155\uD558\uC138\uC694. \uBC29... \uBC29 \uD558\uB098
        \uBD80\uD0C1\uB4DC\uB9BD\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uD558\uB098\uBA74 \uB3FC\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Two nights. Maybe three. I'll know more tomorrow. Probably.
      textKo: "\uC774\uD2C0\uC774\uC694. \uC0AC\uD758\uC77C \uC218\uB3C4 \uC788\uACE0\uC694.
        \uB0B4\uC77C\uC774\uBA74 \uD655\uC2E4\uD574\uC9C8 \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC544\uB9C8\uB3C4\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Long day. Very long. You have no idea.
      textKo: "\uAE34 \uD558\uB8E8\uC600\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC544\uC8FC \uAE38\uC5C8\uC5B4\uC694.
        \uB9D0\uB3C4 \uB9C8\uC138\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Oh - and could someone tidy the room in the mornings? Just... leave
        the case where it is.
      textKo: "\uC544, \uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0 - \uC544\uCE68\uC5D0 \uBC29 \uC880 \uC815\uB9AC\uD574
        \uC8FC\uC2E4 \uC218 \uC788\uC744\uAE4C\uC694? \uAC00\uBC29\uC740... \uADF8\uB0E5
        \uADF8 \uC790\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uB450\uC2DC\uACE0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: case
    labelEn: Ask about his suitcase
    labelKo: "\uAC00\uBC29\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Samples! Brushes mostly. Nothing you'd want. Nothing at all.
      textKo: "\uD310\uB9E4\uC6A9 \uACAC\uBCF8\uC774\uC5D0\uC694! \uB300\uBD80\uBD84
        \uCCAD\uC18C\uC194\uC774\uACE0\uC694. \uD0D0\uB098\uC2E4 \uBB3C\uAC74\uC740
        \uC5C6\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC815\uB9D0 \uC544\uBB34\uAC83\uB3C4\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: shaking
    labelEn: Ask why he's shaking
    labelKo: "\uC65C \uB5A8\uACE0 \uC788\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Cold out. That's all. Just the cold.
      textKo: "\uBC16\uC774 \uCD94\uC6CC\uC11C \uADF8\uB798\uC694. \uADF8\uAC8C \uB2E4\uC608\uC694.
        \uADF8\uB0E5 \uCD94\uC704 \uD0D3\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Let it go
      labelKo: "\uB118\uC5B4\uAC04\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    - labelEn: Press him
      labelKo: "\uCD94\uAD81\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: shaking_press
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: shaking_press
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: I said it's the cold! Are we done here?
      textKo: "\uCD94\uC704 \uB54C\uBB38\uC774\uB77C\uACE0 \uD588\uC796\uC544\uC694!
        \uC774\uC81C \uB410\uC2B5\uB2C8\uAE4C?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Ask how long he's staying
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60\uC774\uB098 \uC788\uC744 \uAC74\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Two. Definitely two. ...Unless the roads stay bad. Then three. Four
        at the very most.
      textKo: "\uC774\uD2C0\uC774\uC694. \uD655\uC2E4\uD788 \uC774\uD2C0\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        ...\uAE38 \uC0AC\uC815\uC774 \uACC4\uC18D \uC548 \uC88B\uC73C\uBA74 \uC0AC\uD758.
        \uAE38\uC5B4\uC57C \uB098\uD758\uC774\uACE0\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Ask for payment up front
      labelKo: "\uC120\uBD88\uB85C \uBC1B\uACA0\uB2E4\uACE0 \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_pay_refused
    - labelEn: Say he can settle later
      labelKo: "\uB5A0\uB0A0 \uB54C \uC815\uC0B0\uD558\uC790\uACE0 \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_later
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_pay_refused
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Up front? I - not now. Please. When I leave. You'll have all of it,
        I promise.
      textKo: "\uC120\uBD88\uC774\uC694? \uC800 - \uC9C0\uAE08\uC740 \uC880. \uC81C\uBC1C\uC694.
        \uB098\uAC08 \uB54C\uC694. \uC804\uBD80 \uB2E4 \uB4DC\uB9B4\uAC8C\uC694,
        \uC57D\uC18D\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_later
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: When I leave. Good. Better. Much better, actually.
      textKo: "\uB098\uAC08 \uB54C\uC694. \uC88B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uADF8\uAC8C
        \uB0AB\uC8E0. \uD6E8\uC52C \uB0AB\uB124\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Mornings would be best. I'm usually out by then. Usually.
      textKo: "\uC544\uCE68\uC774 \uC81C\uC77C \uC88B\uC544\uC694. \uADF8\uB550 \uBCF4\uD1B5
        \uB098\uAC00 \uC788\uC73C\uB2C8\uAE4C\uC694. \uBCF4\uD1B5\uC740\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Clean every morning
      labelKo: "\uB9E4\uC77C \uC544\uCE68 \uCCAD\uC18C\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_yes
    - labelEn: Leave the room alone
      labelKo: "\uBC29\uC740 \uAC74\uB4DC\uB9AC\uC9C0 \uC54A\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_no
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_yes
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. Just - the samples. Don't move the samples.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uADF8\uB0E5 - \uACAC\uBCF8\uB9CC\uC694.
        \uACAC\uBCF8\uC740 \uC62E\uAE30\uC9C0 \uB9D0\uC544 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_no
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...Actually, yes. Better. I'll manage it myself.
      textKo: "...\uC0AC\uC2E4, \uB124. \uADF8\uAC8C \uB0AB\uACA0\uC5B4\uC694. \uC81C\uAC00
        \uC54C\uC544\uC11C \uD558\uC8E0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn them away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: No? Please. I can pay double. Double, for one room.
      textKo: "\uC548 \uB41C\uB2E4\uACE0\uC694? \uC81C\uBC1C\uC694. \uB450 \uBC30\uB85C
        \uB0B4\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uBC29 \uD558\uB098\uC5D0 \uB450 \uBC30\uB85C\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Where else is open? Nowhere. You know that.
      textKo: "\uB2E4\uB978 \uB370\uAC00 \uC5B4\uB514 \uC5F4\uC5C8\uACA0\uC5B4\uC694?
        \uC5C6\uC5B4\uC694. \uC544\uC2DC\uC796\uC544\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Hold firm
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB798\uB3C4 \uAC70\uC808\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_final
    - labelEn: Take the double
      labelKo: "\uB450 \uBC30\uB97C \uBC1B\uACE0 \uB4E4\uC778\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_double_accept
    - labelEn: Let him stay
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uBC1B\uC544\uC900\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_double_accept
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Double. Yes. Thank you - thank you. Here - take it.
      textKo: "\uB450 \uBC30\uC694. \uB124. \uAC10\uC0AC\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4 - \uAC10\uC0AC\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC5EC\uAE30 - \uBC1B\uC73C\uC138\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: This is a mistake. You'll see.
      textKo: "\uC774\uAC74 \uC2E4\uC218\uC608\uC694. \uB450\uACE0 \uBCF4\uC138\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Fine. FINE. I'm going.
      textKo: "\uC54C\uC558\uC5B4\uC694. \uC54C\uC558\uB2E4\uACE0\uC694. \uAC11\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Oh thank you. You won't even know I'm here.
      textKo: "\uC544, \uAC10\uC0AC\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC788\uB294 \uC904\uB3C4
        \uBAA8\uB974\uC2E4 \uAC70\uC608\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Wh- who is it? It's the middle of the night.
      textKo: "\uB204, \uB204\uAD6C\uC138\uC694? \uC9C0\uAE08 \uD55C\uBC24\uC911\uC778\uB370\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...Oh. It's you. I didn't do anything. I've been in my room the whole
        time.
      textKo: "...\uC544. \uB2F9\uC2E0\uC774\uAD70\uC694. \uC800 \uC544\uBB34\uAC83\uB3C4
        \uC548 \uD588\uC5B4\uC694. \uACC4\uC18D \uBC29\uC5D0\uB9CC \uC788\uC5C8\uC5B4\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: noise
    labelEn: Ask about the noise last night
    labelKo: "\uAC04\uBC24\uC758 \uC18C\uC74C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Noise? No. I didn't hear anything. I was asleep. Mostly.
      textKo: "\uC18C\uC74C\uC774\uC694? \uC544\uB2C8\uC694. \uC544\uBB34\uAC83\uB3C4
        \uBABB \uB4E4\uC5C8\uC5B4\uC694. \uC790\uACE0 \uC788\uC5C8\uC5B4\uC694. \uAC70\uC758\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: night
    labelEn: Ask what he did all night
    labelKo: "\uBC24\uC0C8 \uBB58 \uD588\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Packing. Repacking. The samples have to sit a certain way, or they-
        it doesn't matter. Why?
      textKo: "\uC9D0 \uC2F8\uACE0. \uB2E4\uC2DC \uC2F8\uACE0. \uACAC\uBCF8\uC740
        \uB531 \uB9DE\uAC8C \uB123\uC5B4\uC57C \uC548 \uADF8\uB7EC\uBA74- \uC544\uBB34\uD2BC\uC694.
        \uC65C\uC694?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 2
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: seen
    labelEn: Ask if he saw anything
    labelKo: "\uC774\uC0C1\uD55C \uAC78 \uBABB \uBD24\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: Through what window? The curtains stayed shut. They stay shut. Are
        we done here?
      textKo: "\uBB34\uC2A8 \uCC3D\uBB38\uC73C\uB85C\uC694? \uCEE4\uD2BC\uC740 \uACC4\uC18D
        \uCCD0\uB1A8\uC5B4\uC694. \uACC4\uC18D\uC694. \uC774\uC81C \uB410\uC8E0?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: You run this place? Hm. Explains the smell.
      textKo: "\uC5EC\uAE30 \uC8FC\uC778\uC774 \uB2F9\uC2E0\uC774\uC57C? \uD760.
        \uC5B4\uCA50\uC9C0 \uB0C4\uC0C8\uAC00 \uB098\uB354\uB77C."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: A room. And be quick about it - I've wasted enough of my night on this
        road.
      textKo: "\uBC29 \uD558\uB098. \uBE68\uB9AC\uBE68\uB9AC \uD574 - \uC774 \uAE38\uBC14\uB2E5\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uBC24\uC0C8 \uC2DC\uAC04 \uBC84\uB838\uC73C\uB2C8\uAE4C."
    - expression: 1
      textEn: And nobody sets foot in my room. No maid, not you. Understood?
      textKo: "\uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0 \uB0B4 \uBC29\uC5D4 \uC544\uBB34\uB3C4 \uBC1C \uB4E4\uC774\uC9C0
        \uB9C8. \uCCAD\uC18C\uBD80\uB3C4, \uB108\uB3C4. \uC54C\uC544\uB4E4\uC5C8\uC5B4?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: wait
    labelEn: Ask him to wait a moment
    labelKo: "\uC7A0\uC2DC \uAE30\uB2E4\uB824 \uB2EC\uB77C\uACE0 \uD55C\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: Wait? You work here. I don't wait for the help.
      textKo: "\uAE30\uB2E4\uB824? \uB10C \uC5EC\uAE30 \uC9C1\uC6D0\uC774\uC796\uC544.
        \uB09C \uC885\uC5C5\uC6D0 \uB098\uBD80\uB7AD\uC774 \uC548 \uAE30\uB2E4\uB824."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: id
    labelEn: Ask for identification
    labelKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC744 \uC694\uAD6C\uD55C\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Identification. In a place like this. That's almost funny.
      textKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D. \uC774\uB534 \uB370\uC11C. \uC6C3\uAE30\uC9C0\uB3C4
        \uC54A\uB294\uAD70."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Insist on ID
      labelKo: "\uC2E0\uBD84\uC99D\uC744 \uACC4\uC18D \uC694\uAD6C\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: id_show
    - labelEn: Wave him through
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uB4E4\uC5EC\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: id_show
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: ...There. Take a good look. Try not to move your lips when you read
        it.
      textKo: "...\uC790. \uC2E4\uCEF7 \uBD10. \uAE00 \uC77D\uC744 \uB54C \uC785\uC220
        \uC880 \uC548 \uC6C0\uC9C1\uC774\uBA74 \uC88B\uACA0\uB294\uB370."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Ask how many nights
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60 \uBB35\uC744\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Two nights. Maybe three. You'll find out when I tell you.
      textKo: "\uC774\uD2C0. \uC0AC\uD758\uC77C \uC218\uB3C4 \uC788\uACE0. \uB0B4\uAC00
        \uB9D0\uD574\uC8FC\uBA74 \uADF8\uB54C \uC54C\uACA0\uC9C0."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Demand payment up front
      labelKo: "\uC120\uBD88\uC744 \uC694\uAD6C\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_pay
    - labelEn: Let it slide
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB0E5 \uB118\uC5B4\uAC04\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_skip
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_pay
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: Up front. From me. That's adorable. ...Fine. You'll get it. Now move.
      textKo: "\uC120\uBD88. \uB098\uD55C\uD14C. \uADC0\uC5FD\uAD70. ...\uC88B\uC544.
        \uC8FC\uC9C0. \uBE68\uB9AC \uC6C0\uC9C1\uC774\uAE30\uB098 \uD574."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_skip
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Smart. You learn fast, for someone in your position.
      textKo: "\uB611\uB611\uD558\uB124. \uADF8 \uC8FC\uC81C\uC5D0 \uB208\uCE58\uB294
        \uC788\uACE0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: I said no. Are you slow? The door stays shut. I clean up after myself.
      textKo: "\uC548 \uB41C\uB2E4\uACE0 \uD588\uC796\uC544. \uBA38\uB9AC\uAC00 \uB098\uBE60?
        \uBB38\uC740 \uC7A0\uAC00 \uB46C. \uB0B4 \uB4A4\uCE58\uB2E4\uAEBC\uB9AC\uB294
        \uB0B4\uAC00 \uD574."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn them away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: Excuse me?
      textKo: "\uBB50\uB77C\uACE0?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: reject_insist
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_insist
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: You're turning ME away. From a roadside dump like this.
      textKo: "\uB0A0 \uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4\uACE0. \uC774\uB534 \uAE38\uAC00
        \uC4F0\uB808\uAE30\uC7A5\uC5D0\uC11C."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Stand your ground
      labelKo: "\uBB3C\uB7EC\uC11C\uC9C0 \uC54A\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_final
    - labelEn: Back down
      labelKo: "\uBB3C\uB7EC\uC120\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: You'll wish you hadn't. People like you always do.
      textKo: "\uD6C4\uD68C\uD558\uAC8C \uB420 \uAC70\uC57C. \uB108 \uAC19\uC740
        \uAC83\uB4E4\uC740 \uAF2D \uADF8\uB7EC\uB354\uB77C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Finally. Try to be less useless tomorrow.
      textKo: "\uB4DC\uB514\uC5B4. \uB0B4\uC77C\uC740 \uC880 \uB35C \uAD7C\uB728\uB4E0\uAC00."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin_paid
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: There's your money. The whole stay, up front, since you had to make
        it weird.
      textKo: "\uB3C8 \uC5EC\uAE30 \uC788\uB2E4. \uC219\uBC15\uBE44 \uC804\uC561,
        \uC120\uBD88\uB85C. \uAF2D \uC720\uB09C\uC744 \uB5A8\uC5B4\uC57C \uD588\uC73C\uB2C8\uAE4C."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Finally. Try to be less useless tomorrow.
      textKo: "\uB4DC\uB514\uC5B4. \uB0B4\uC77C\uC740 \uC880 \uB35C \uAD7C\uB728\uB4E0\uAC00."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: Do you have any idea what time it is? You're pounding on my door.
      textKo: "\uC9C0\uAE08 \uBA87 \uC2E0 \uC904\uC774\uB098 \uC54C\uC544? \uB0B4
        \uBC29 \uBB38\uC744 \uB450\uB4DC\uB824\uB300\uACE0 \uC788\uC796\uC544."
    - expression: 1
      textEn: This had better be good.
      textKo: "\uC6A9\uAC74\uC774 \uB300\uB2E8\uD574\uC57C \uD560 \uAC70\uC57C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: noise
    labelEn: Ask about the noise last night
    labelKo: "\uAC04\uBC24\uC758 \uC18C\uC74C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: The only noise in this dump is you. Right now. Deal with it yourself.
      textKo: "\uC774 \uC4F0\uB808\uAE30\uC7A5\uC5D0\uC11C \uC2DC\uB044\uB7EC\uC6B4
        \uAC74 \uB108\uBFD0\uC774\uC57C. \uC9C0\uAE08 \uC774 \uC21C\uAC04. \uC54C\uC544\uC11C
        \uCC98\uB9AC\uD574."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: night
    labelEn: Ask what he did all night
    labelKo: "\uBC24\uC0C8 \uBB58 \uD588\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: I slept. Or tried to. Hard to rest in a place that lets anyone wander
        the halls.
      textKo: "\uC7A4\uC5B4. \uC790\uB824\uACE0\uB294 \uD588\uC9C0. \uC544\uBB34\uB098
        \uBCF5\uB3C4\uB97C \uC5B4\uC2AC\uB801\uB300\uB294 \uB370\uC11C \uC7A0\uC774
        \uC624\uACA0\uB0D0\uB9CC."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 3
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: halls
    labelEn: Ask who was in the halls
    labelKo: "\uBCF5\uB3C4\uC5D0 \uB204\uAC00 \uC788\uC5C8\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: How would I know? I wasn't standing guard. That's supposed to be your
        job.
      textKo: "\uB0B4\uAC00 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uC54C\uC544? \uBCF4\uCD08 \uC11C\uACE0
        \uC788\uB358 \uAC83\uB3C4 \uC544\uB2C8\uACE0. \uADF8\uAC8C \uB124 \uC77C
        \uC544\uB2C8\uC5C8\uB0D0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: A room. Away from the road if you have one.
      textKo: "\uBC29 \uD558\uB098\uC694. \uAC00\uB2A5\uD558\uBA74 \uAE38\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uBA3C \uCABD\uC73C\uB85C\uC694."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I don't know how many nights yet. Is that a problem?
      textKo: "\uBA70\uCE60 \uBB35\uC744\uC9C0\uB294 \uC544\uC9C1 \uBAB0\uB77C\uC694.
        \uADF8\uAC8C \uBB38\uC81C\uAC00 \uB418\uB098\uC694?"
    - expression: 0
      textEn: No housekeeping, please. I'll see to the room myself.
      textKo: "\uCCAD\uC18C\uB294 \uC548 \uD558\uC154\uB3C4 \uB3FC\uC694. \uBC29\uC740
        \uC81C\uAC00 \uC54C\uC544\uC11C \uD560\uAC8C\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: road
    labelEn: Ask why away from the road
    labelKo: "\uC65C \uAE38\uC5D0\uC11C \uBA3C \uCABD\uC778\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I sleep lighter than most.
      textKo: "\uC81C\uAC00 \uC7A0\uADC0\uAC00 \uC880 \uBC1D\uC740 \uD3B8\uC774\uB77C\uC11C\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: alone
    labelEn: Ask if she's travelling alone
    labelKo: "\uD63C\uC790 \uC5EC\uD589 \uC911\uC778\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Is that a requirement?
      textKo: "\uADF8\uAC8C \uC870\uAC74\uC778\uAC00\uC694?"
    choices:
    - labelEn: Ask gently
      labelKo: "\uBD80\uB4DC\uB7FD\uAC8C \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: alone_soft
    - labelEn: Ask straight
      labelKo: "\uB2E8\uB3C4\uC9C1\uC785\uC801\uC73C\uB85C \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: alone_hard
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: alone_soft
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...Yes. Alone.
      textKo: "...\uB124. \uD63C\uC790\uC608\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: alone_hard
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: That's my business. Not yours.
      textKo: "\uC81C \uC77C\uC774\uC5D0\uC694. \uB2F9\uC2E0\uC774 \uC0C1\uAD00\uD560
        \uBC14 \uC544\uB2C8\uACE0\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Ask how long she'll stay
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60 \uC788\uC744 \uAC74\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: One night for certain. After that, I'll tell you each morning.
      textKo: "\uD558\uB8FB\uBC24\uC740 \uD655\uC2E4\uD574\uC694. \uADF8\uB2E4\uC74C\uC740
        \uB9E4\uC77C \uC544\uCE68\uC5D0 \uB9D0\uC500\uB4DC\uB9B4\uAC8C\uC694."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Charge one night at a time
      labelKo: "\uD558\uB8E8\uCE58\uC529\uB9CC \uBC1B\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_ok
    - labelEn: Demand an exact date
      labelKo: "\uC815\uD655\uD55C \uB0A0\uC9DC\uB97C \uC694\uAD6C\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_press
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_ok
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Thank you. That's easier for both of us.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9C8\uC6CC\uC694. \uADF8\uAC8C \uC11C\uB85C \uD3B8\uD558\uC8E0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_press
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 1
      textEn: I said I don't know. Pushing me won't change that.
      textKo: "\uBAA8\uB978\uB2E4\uACE0 \uD588\uC796\uC544\uC694. \uBAB0\uC544\uBD99\uC5EC\uB3C4
        \uC18C\uC6A9\uC5C6\uC5B4\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I already told you. Leave the room to me.
      textKo: "\uC774\uBBF8 \uB9D0\uC500\uB4DC\uB838\uC796\uC544\uC694. \uBC29\uC740
        \uC800\uD55C\uD14C \uB9E1\uAE30\uC138\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn them away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I see.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uB807\uAD70\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: reject_final
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I'll find somewhere. I always do.
      textKo: "\uC5B4\uB514\uB4E0 \uCC3E\uACA0\uC8E0. \uB298 \uADF8\uB798\uC654\uC73C\uB2C8\uAE4C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Good. Don't knock after dark.
      textKo: "\uC88B\uC544\uC694. \uC5B4\uB450\uC6CC\uC9C4 \uB4A4\uC5D4 \uBB38 \uB450\uB4DC\uB9AC\uC9C0
        \uB9C8\uC138\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 4
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: refuse
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...I told you not to knock after dark. Go back. We'll talk in the morning.
      textKo: "...\uC5B4\uB450\uC6CC\uC9C0\uBA74 \uB450\uB4DC\uB9AC\uC9C0 \uB9D0\uB7AC\uC8E0.
        \uB3CC\uC544\uAC00\uC138\uC694. \uC598\uAE30\uB294 \uC544\uCE68\uC5D0 \uD558\uC8E0."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Evening evening! Cold one out there tonight isn't it?
      textKo: "\uBC18\uAC11\uC18C, \uBC18\uAC11\uC18C! \uC624\uB298 \uBC24 \uBC14\uAE65\uC774
        \uAF64 \uCDA5\uAD6C\uB824."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Room for an old man's bones?
      textKo: "\uC774 \uB299\uC740 \uBAB8 \uB260 \uBC29 \uD558\uB098 \uC788\uACA0\uC18C?"
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I'll be under your roof a week or so - these knees don't travel like
        they used to.
      textKo: "\uD55C \uC77C\uC8FC\uC77C\uCBE4 \uC2E0\uC138 \uC880 \uC9C0\uB824 \uD558\uC624.
        \uBB34\uB98E\uC774 \uC608\uC804 \uAC19\uC9C8 \uC54A\uC544\uC11C \uB9D0\uC774\uC624."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: If it's no trouble - a quick tidy each morning would be a kindness.
        These hands don't do much anymore.
      textKo: "\uAD1C\uCC2E\uC73C\uC2DC\uBA74 - \uC544\uCE68\uB9C8\uB2E4 \uC7A0\uAE50
        \uC815\uB9AC\uD574 \uC8FC\uC2DC\uBA74 \uACE0\uB9D9\uACA0\uC18C. \uC774 \uC190\uC774
        \uC608\uC804 \uAC19\uC9C8 \uC54A\uC544\uC11C \uB9D0\uC774\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: trip
    labelEn: Ask about his journey
    labelKo: "\uC5EC\uC815\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Oh it's a long story. Which part do you want?
      textKo: "\uC544, \uAE34 \uC774\uC57C\uAE30\uB77C\uC624. \uC5B4\uB290 \uB300\uBAA9\uC774
        \uAD81\uAE08\uD558\uC2DC\uC624?"
    choices:
    - labelEn: The beginning
      labelKo: "\uCC98\uC74C\uBD80\uD130 \uB4E3\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: trip_begin
    - labelEn: The short version
      labelKo: "\uC9E7\uAC8C \uB4E3\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: trip_short
    - labelEn: Skip it
      labelKo: "\uADF8\uB9CC \uB4E3\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: trip_begin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: It started forty years back in a town that isn't on the maps anymore...
      textKo: "\uC0AC\uC2ED \uB144 \uC804, \uC774\uC81C\uB294 \uC9C0\uB3C4\uC5D0\uB3C4
        \uC5C6\uB294 \uB9C8\uC744\uC5D0\uC11C \uC2DC\uC791\uB410\uB2E4\uC624..."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: trip_short
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Visiting family. Or what's left of them.
      textKo: "\uAC00\uC871\uC744 \uBCF4\uB7EC \uAC00\uB294 \uAE38\uC774\uC624. \uB0A8\uC740
        \uC0AC\uB78C\uC774 \uC5BC\uB9C8 \uC5C6\uC9C0\uB9CC."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: weather
    labelEn: Ask about the weather
    labelKo: "\uB0A0\uC528\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Storm's coming. Mark my words. Sky goes green first.
      textKo: "\uD3ED\uD48D\uC774 \uC624\uACE0 \uC788\uC18C. \uB0B4 \uB9D0 \uBA85\uC2EC\uD558\uC2DC\uC624.
        \uD558\uB298\uBD80\uD130 \uCD08\uB85D\uBE5B\uC73C\uB85C \uBB3C\uB4E0\uB2E4\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: stay
    labelEn: Ask how many nights
    labelKo: "\uBA70\uCE60\uC774\uB098 \uBB35\uC744\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: A week ought to do it. Though if that storm settles in - well, who's
        to say.
      textKo: "\uC77C\uC8FC\uC77C\uC774\uBA74 \uB418\uC9C0 \uC2F6\uC18C. \uBB50,
        \uADF8 \uD3ED\uD48D\uC774 \uB20C\uB7EC\uC549\uC73C\uBA74 - \uAE00\uC384,
        \uBAA8\uB97C \uC77C\uC774\uC624\uB9CC."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Book the whole week
      labelKo: "\uC77C\uC8FC\uC77C\uCE58\uB97C \uD55C \uBC88\uC5D0 \uC801\uB294\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_week
    - labelEn: Charge him day by day
      labelKo: "\uD558\uB8E8\uC529 \uBC1B\uACA0\uB2E4\uACE0 \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: stay_daily
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_week
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Kind of you. Settles an old mind.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uAD6C\uB824. \uB299\uC740\uC774 \uB9C8\uC74C\uC774 \uB193\uC774\uB294\uAD6C\uB824."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: stay_daily
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: That suits me fine. Day by day - that's about my speed now.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uAC83\uB3C4 \uC88B\uC18C. \uD558\uB8E8\uD558\uB8E8 - \uC694\uC998
        \uB0B4 \uAC78\uC74C\uAC78\uC774\uAC00 \uB531 \uADF8\uB807\uB2E4\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: need
    labelEn: Ask if he needs anything
    labelKo: "\uD544\uC694\uD55C \uAC8C \uC788\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Kind of you to ask.
      textKo: "\uBB3C\uC5B4\uBD10 \uC8FC\uB2C8 \uACE0\uB9D9\uAD6C\uB824."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Offer an extra blanket
      labelKo: "\uB2F4\uC694\uB97C \uB354 \uC900\uB2E4"
      goToNode: need_blanket
    - labelEn: Offer a hot meal
      labelKo: "\uB530\uB73B\uD55C \uC2DD\uC0AC\uB97C \uAD8C\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: need_meal
    - labelEn: Nothing for now
      labelKo: "\uC9C0\uAE08\uC740 \uB410\uB2E4\uACE0 \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: need_blanket
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Bless you. These old knees will thank you.
      textKo: "\uACE0\uB9D9\uAE30\uB3C4 \uD558\uC624. \uC774 \uB299\uC740 \uBB34\uB98E\uC774
        \uACE0\uB9C8\uC6CC\uD560 \uAC8C\uC694."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: need_meal
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I wouldn't say no to that.
      textKo: "\uADF8\uAC70\uB77C\uBA74 \uB9C8\uB2E4\uD558\uC9C0 \uC54A\uACA0\uC18C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: clean
    labelEn: Ask about housekeeping
    labelKo: "\uD558\uC6B0\uC2A4\uD0A4\uD551\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uD560\uC9C0
      \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: A look-in of a morning would do me fine. I keep to my chair mostly.
      textKo: "\uC544\uCE68\uC5D0 \uD55C \uBC88 \uB4E4\uC5EC\uB2E4\uBD10 \uC8FC\uBA74
        \uB418\uC624. \uB09C \uAC70\uC758 \uC758\uC790\uC5D0\uB9CC \uC549\uC544 \uC788\uC73C\uB2C8."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Tidy up every morning
      labelKo: "\uB9E4\uC77C \uC544\uCE68 \uC815\uB9AC\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_yes
    - labelEn: Only when he asks
      labelKo: "\uBD80\uD0C1\uD560 \uB54C\uB9CC \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: clean_no
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_yes
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Bless you. An old man sleeps easier for it.
      textKo: "\uBCF5 \uBC1B\uC73C\uC2DC\uC624. \uB299\uC740\uC774\uAC00 \uBC1C \uBED7\uACE0
        \uC790\uACA0\uC18C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: clean_no
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: As you like. I'll call out if I need a hand.
      textKo: "\uC88B\uC744 \uB300\uB85C \uD558\uC2DC\uC624. \uC190\uC774 \uD544\uC694\uD558\uBA74
        \uBD80\uB974\uB9AC\uB2E4."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: reject
    labelEn: Turn them away
    labelKo: "\uB3CC\uB824\uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Oh. Oh dear. On a night like this?
      textKo: "\uC774\uB7F0. \uC800\uB7F0. \uC774\uB7F0 \uBC24\uC5D0 \uB9D0\uC774\uC624?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: reject_insist
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_insist
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: I don't move so fast anymore. Have a heart.
      textKo: "\uC774\uC81C \uAC78\uC74C\uB3C4 \uB290\uB9AC\uB2E4\uC624. \uC880 \uBD10\uC8FC\uC2DC\uAD6C\uB824."
    choices:
    - labelEn: Refuse
      labelKo: "\uAC70\uC808\uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: reject_final
    - labelEn: Let him stay
      labelKo: "\uBB35\uAC8C \uD55C\uB2E4"
      goToNode: 
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: reject_final
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: ...Alright. Sorry to have troubled you.
      textKo: "...\uC54C\uACA0\uC18C. \uADC0\uCC2E\uAC8C \uD574\uC11C \uBBF8\uC548\uD558\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 2
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 0
    day: 0
    role: 3
    nodeKey: checkin
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Bless you son. Sleep well now.
      textKo: "\uBCF5 \uBC1B\uC73C\uC2DC\uAD6C\uB824. \uD3B8\uD788 \uC8FC\uBB34\uC2DC\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 0
    nodeKey: 
    labelEn: 
    labelKo: 
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Mm? Goodness, at this hour? These old ears barely caught the knock.
      textKo: "\uC74C? \uC544\uC774\uACE0, \uC774 \uC2DC\uAC04\uC5D0? \uB299\uC740
        \uADC0\uB85C\uB294 \uB178\uD06C \uC18C\uB9AC\uB3C4 \uACA8\uC6B0 \uB4E4\uC5C8\uC18C."
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Come now. What is it, son?
      textKo: "\uC790, \uC790. \uBB34\uC2A8 \uC77C\uC774\uC624, \uC80A\uC740\uC774?"
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: noise
    labelEn: Ask about the noise last night
    labelKo: "\uAC04\uBC24\uC758 \uC18C\uC74C\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Heard it plain. Something scratching, past the wall. On and on. Told
        myself it was the wind.
      textKo: "\uB611\uB611\uD788 \uB4E4\uC5C8\uC18C. \uBCBD \uB108\uBA38\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uBB54\uAC00 \uAE01\uB294 \uC18C\uB9AC. \uACC4\uC18D, \uACC4\uC18D. \uBC14\uB78C\uC774\uACA0\uAC70\uB2C8
        \uD588\uC9C0\uB9CC."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: night
    labelEn: Ask what he did all night
    labelKo: "\uBC24\uC0C8 \uBB58 \uD588\uB294\uC9C0 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Up twice for the washroom - the knees, you know. The hall was empty
        both times. Dark as a well.
      textKo: "\uD654\uC7A5\uC2E4 \uB450 \uBC88 \uB2E4\uB140\uC654\uC18C - \uBB34\uB98E
        \uB54C\uBB38\uC5D0 \uB9D0\uC774\uC624. \uB450 \uBC88 \uB2E4 \uBCF5\uB3C4\uB294
        \uBE44\uC5B4 \uC788\uC5C8\uACE0. \uC6B0\uBB3C \uC18D\uCC98\uB7FC \uCE84\uCE84\uD588\uC18C."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
  - npcId: 5
    situation: 1
    day: 0
    role: 1
    nodeKey: storm
    labelEn: Ask about the storm he mentioned
    labelKo: "\uB9D0\uD588\uB358 \uD3ED\uD48D\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uBB3B\uB294\uB2E4"
    lines:
    - expression: 0
      textEn: Look at the sky before you sleep. It's already turning. Green at the
        edges. It always starts that way.
      textKo: "\uC790\uAE30 \uC804\uC5D0 \uD558\uB298\uC744 \uBCF4\uC2DC\uC624. \uBC8C\uC368
        \uBCC0\uD558\uACE0 \uC788\uC18C. \uAC00\uC7A5\uC790\uB9AC\uBD80\uD130 \uCD08\uB85D\uBE5B\uC73C\uB85C.
        \uB298 \uADF8\uB807\uAC8C \uC2DC\uC791\uD55C\uB2E4\uC624."
    choices: []
    goToNode: 
    outcome: 0
